RUAR evaluation summaries report the Accuracy-Efficiency Score (AES) formula
following the O1-Pruner evaluation metric. The AES implementation in
ruar_eval/metrics.py is a local reporting utility and is not part of the RUAR
training method.

Portions of RUAR's boxed-answer evaluation utilities are adapted from DEER
(Dynamic Early Exit in Reasoning Models), MIT License.

